### Public: Get all games
GET http://localhost:8080/games


### Login and save JWT token
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "password"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}


### Protected: Add game with JWT
POST http://localhost:8080/games
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Minecraft",
  "genre": "Sandbox",
  "platform": "PC"
}


### Protected: Try duplicate game with JWT
POST http://localhost:8080/games
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Minecraft",
  "genre": "Sandbox",
  "platform": "PC"
}


### Public: Get game by id
GET http://localhost:8080/games/1


### Protected: Update game with JWT
PUT http://localhost:8080/games/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Minecraft Java Edition",
  "genre": "Sandbox",
  "platform": "PC"
}


### Protected: Delete game with JWT
DELETE http://localhost:8080/games/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}